        "created_at": "2022-05-16T20:46:38.552Z",
        "cooked": "<p>hello. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/bailey\">@bailey</a> just came into my office and anointed me with a sword that said “LORD OF FORUMS”. I believe that means I am your problem now.</p>\n<p>(what xir actually said was something like, “they’re very sweet, the best kind of people”, so feel free to let that go to your head)</p>\n<p>I’ve just joined the team at GTG as the new Brand Manager, so please give me a shout if you want to chat about anything! I can’t promise that I’ll always be able to give you an answer, but I like to hear what people have to say. I’ll be lurking here otherwise.</p>\n<p>Discussion Topic: what would your walk-on music be if you were a small-time local wrestler? I’d probably pick <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wm-di7Ht6Bc\">Hit and Run</a> by LOLO, I feel like it has the right mix of brash hype, especially  the chorus of “history will hate us/but they’ll never forget our names”</p>",
